# D-113 (steps/defects.md): a field path deeper than one field inside an expression -- `m\in\x + m\a` --
# is read by the general path walk; the single-hop check took `m\in` and refused "unresolved name" on a
# name that resolves.  Through a copy of Outer (5 + 1) and a copy of Other (5 + 10, admitted by name): 6 + 15 = 21.
# Success is 7.
Inner:
    size_t: x 5U
end: Inner
Outer:
    in:
        size_t: x 5U
    size_t: a 1U
end: Outer
Other:
    size_t: a 10U
    in:
        size_t: x 5U
end: Other
fn: rd (Outer: m) size_t
    return: m\in\x + m\a
fn: go () size_t
    o: merge Outer
    p: merge Other
    size_t: u rd(o)
    size_t: v rd(p)
    return: u + v
size_t: got 0U
got: go()
int: ok 3
if: got = 21U
    ok: 7
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: ok; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
